potential views on China

00:50:39.490 --> 00:50:40.790
and responses to soft power,

00:50:40.790 --> 00:50:43.301
especially because one
of China's soft power,

00:50:43.301 --> 00:50:45.680
and what some also described
as "sharp power," strategies is

00:50:45.680 --> 00:50:47.910
to target Chinese communities overseas.

00:50:47.910 --> 00:50:48.743
So, at the very least,

00:50:48.743 --> 00:50:50.100
some of these people
might be also answering

00:50:50.100 --> 00:50:51.120
your questions in a survey

00:50:51.120 --> 00:50:52.840
because it's a very high percentage.

00:50:52.840 --> 00:50:54.180
I think that would be very interesting.

00:50:54.180 --> 00:50:56.030
And the last point that just came up to me

00:50:56.030 --> 00:50:57.260
