00:59:40.990 --> 00:59:41.910
very much interesting,

00:59:41.910 --> 00:59:45.710
but if I take a closer
look into the treatments,

00:59:45.710 --> 00:59:48.910
for instance, in the Japanese
foreign aid treatment,

00:59:48.910 --> 00:59:51.607
it includes its support for the POSCO

00:59:51.607 --> 00:59:52.930
in South Korea,

00:59:52.930 --> 00:59:55.785
which is actually a very
sensitive issue in South Korea.

00:59:55.785 --> 00:59:59.530
With regard to the the
Japanese financial aid

00:59:59.530 --> 01:00:01.120
and its recipient in South Korea

01:00:01.120 --> 01:00:03.483
after 1965 treaty,

01:00:04.342 --> 01:00:06.100
it is not difficult to imagine

01:00:06.100 --> 01:00:08.410
that some South Korean
participants are offended

01:00:08.410 --> 01:00:11.240
by this reference to POSCO, for instance.

01:00:11.240 --> 01:00:12.540
The Chinese foreign aid treatment

01:00:12.540 --> 01:00:15.180
also includes its support
for Malaysian sea freight.

01:00:15.180 --> 01:00:18.360
So these kinds of bilateral foreign aid is

01:00:18.360 --> 01:00:21.360
actually included in these stimuli,

01:00:21.360 --> 01:00:24.040
and that would have some
kind of specific effects,

01:00:24.040 --> 01:00:27.381
depending on the context of
these bilateral relations.

01:00:27.381 --> 01:00:31.013
The last point is about
the Hong Kong protest.

01:00:33.350 --> 01:00:35.010
So I actually didn't understand

01:00:35.010 --> 01:00:36.480
why Hong Kong protest signifies

01:00:36.480 --> 01:00:38.186
the political value of China.

01:00:38.186 --> 01:00:42.850
Because the reason protests
in Hong Kong are labeled

01:00:42.850 --> 01:00:44.500
as a pro-independence movement

01:00:44.500 --> 01:00:46.420
by the Chinese central government,

01:00:46.420 --> 01:00:47.880
the government initially censored

01:00:47.880 --> 01:00:49.660
the protest related to
information in the mainland

01:00:49.660 --> 01:00:52.226
and afterward, it severely
attacked the movement.

01:00:52.226 --> 01:00:54.550
So therefore, the Hong Kong protests have

01:00:54.550 --> 01:00:56.220
never been something that China would

01:00:56.220 --> 01:00:58.190
like to sell to the world.

01:00:58.190 --> 01:01:00.330
More of a harsh clamp down

01:01:00.330 --> 01:01:01.830
of the protest invoked a lot

01:01:01.830 --> 01:01:04.120
of international criticism.

01:01:04.120 --> 01:01:06.230
So I think the political value

01:01:06.230 --> 01:01:09.030
that China wants to sell is stability

01:01:09.030 --> 01:01:10.817
instead of this kind of,

01:01:10.817 --> 01:01:12.883
"Hey, we also accept protests,

01:01:12.883 --> 01:01:15.230
"we are also free society,"

01:01:15.230 --> 01:01:16.530
that kind of things.

01:01:16.530 --> 01:01:20.400
So I guess it might be
a worthwhile elaborating

01:01:20.400 --> 01:01:21.700
more of the value is that,

01:01:21.700 --> 01:01:24.800
what kind of values that each
country would like to sell.

01:01:24.800 --> 01:01:25.850
So in the case of Japan,

01:01:25.850 --> 01:01:28.119
it might be like kind of Article Nine,

01:01:28.119 --> 01:01:32.610
rather than just showing
the anti-government protest.

01:01:32.610 --> 01:01:35.200
So that will be more general
and fundamental value

01:01:35.200 --> 01:01:36.830
that Japan has something

01:01:36.830 --> 01:01:37.880
to sell to the world.

